From 6ba129f41900612c7dc031f8f46fccb951d55d6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hanzo Dev <dev@hanzo.ai>
Date: Sun, 3 Aug 2025 20:05:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor: migrate MPC from Docker service to native Go
 integration

- Remove app/mpc-service in favor of direct github.com/luxfi/mpc usage
- Add infrastructure services: Lux ID (auth), KMS (Vault), NATS, Consul
- Implement 3-node MPC network with native Go binaries
- Add comprehensive documentation for new architecture
- Update development workflow to use native tools instead of Docker

This refactoring improves performance, simplifies deployment, and provides
better integration with the Lux ecosystem through unified authentication
and secure key management.
